		"collab.activity.welcome.ariaLabel": "{productName} welcome message",
		"collab.activity.welcome.body": "🎉 **Welcome to your {productName} project — a workspace where your team and AI collaborate**\n\nHere's a quick tour of the core features:\n\n📁 **Assets & project settings**: shared resources for the whole team\nDrop project docs and references into **Assets** — everyone on the team can see them, and I'll automatically read them as context. Files I produce during tasks can also be saved to Assets, so the team always has the latest output at hand. Handy experts, Skills, and connectors can be configured at the project level, and every member can use them when kicking off a task.\n\n📋 **Plan board**: assign and track team work\nWant to divvy up work? Just tell me \"assign X to A and Y to B\" and I'll create the todos in the **Plan** board — who owns what is clear at a glance. As things progress or change, I can comment on todos and @mention the right people. The board is the team's work dashboard.\n\n🤝 **Task collaboration**: real-time co-work or hand-off\nWhen several people need to discuss and iterate with me on the same task, switch to **Cloud task** mode below the input, then start **Collaborate** from the top-right of the task chat — everyone works in the same conversation. When you've started something and want a teammate to take it forward, **hand off** the task and both the progress and the current output transfer with it.\n\n⚙️ **Automation**: let repetitive work run itself\nSome workflows need to happen on a schedule — daily news digests, periodic data pulls — configure them in **Automation** and I'll run them at the right time. I use the same tools you do: read from Assets, create todos, and so on. Team workflows can be handed off to me to run automatically.\n\nYour project is ready — happy shipping 🙂",
