		"automation.templates.interviewPreparationReminder.title": "Interview Prep Reminder",
		"automation.templates.interviewPreparationReminder.content": "Every 2 hours on weekdays, remind me to review LLM interview topics and generate 3 mock questions.",
		"automation.templates.preMeetingPreparation.title": "Pre-meeting Preparation",
		"automation.templates.preMeetingPreparation.content": "Before the meeting starts, remind me to organize agenda, goals, key questions, and conclusions to share.",
		"automation.templates.dailyAiNews.prompt": "Track today's top developments in AI, with a focus on AI-assisted coding and embodied intelligence. Curate 3–5 noteworthy items, briefly describing each event and why it matters.",
		"automation.templates.dailyWords.prompt": "Recommend 5 practical vocabulary words each day, prioritizing terms commonly used in daily life and the workplace. Provide the definition, IPA transcription, an example sentence, and one memory tip for each word.",
		"automation.templates.bedtimeStory.prompt": "Write a bedtime story suitable for children—gentle and easy to understand, about 3–5 minutes of reading time. The story should have a complete plot and end with a short moral.",
		"automation.templates.weeklyReport.prompt": "Review this week's repository PR and Issue activity, including new, closed, and actively discussed items. Produce a weekly report covering major progress, key changes, and items that need follow-up.",
		"automation.templates.classicMovie.prompt": "Recommend one widely acclaimed classic film (high ratings, strong word-of-mouth). Briefly describe its plot, highlights, and why it's worth watching—without spoilers.",
		"automation.templates.historyToday.prompt": "What interesting event happened on this day in history? Pick one from tech, film, or music and explain the context in about 200–300 words.",
		"automation.templates.dailyWhy.prompt": "Pick one fun piece of trivia or everyday-science question and give a detailed, engaging, easy-to-understand answer. Try not to repeat previous questions; cover science, daily life, history, nature, food, culture, animals, the human body, and more. Pose the question first, then reveal the answer in a light, entertaining tone, keeping it to 200–300 words.",
		"automation.templates.parentContactReminder.prompt": "Remind me every Sunday at 10:00 to call or message my family and ask how they are doing.",
		"automation.templates.healthCheckupReminder.prompt": "At 07:00 on April 8, remind me to confirm the health-checkup appointment, prepare my ID, fast in advance, and review any other instructions.",
		"automation.templates.interviewPreparationReminder.prompt": "Every 2 hours, remind me to review the project highlights, technical challenges, and common Q&A for LLM-related roles, and generate 3 mock interview questions.",
		"automation.templates.preMeetingPreparation.prompt": "Before the meeting starts, remind me to organize the agenda, goals, questions to confirm, and key conclusions to share.",
		"automation.templates.cutePetWallpaper.prompt": "Generate a phone wallpaper for me. Randomly pick one of the following themes.\nSubject: cute pet. Format: phone wallpaper, high resolution, size 576×1024, 9:16 portrait ratio.\nTheme 1: Fluffy cloud motif — ornate border, creative layout, manga romanticism, lavish and intricate, floating cloud elements, mint-green and sky-blue palette, gentle and adorable.\nTheme 2: A refined minimalist illustration blending blur and brushstroke textures — deep sapphire-blue background, surrealist aesthetics, rich layering, light and reflections creating visual tension while maintaining an elegant harmony.\nTheme 3: Ryo Takemasa-style cartoon wallpaper — screen-printing art style, fine grain texture, soft offset-print quality, minimal flat illustration, featuring a cat as the subject, high-saturation dopamine color palette.\nTheme 4: Virtual electronic style — composed of voxel blocks, garbled text and digital glitch textures, subtly distorted star rings, holographic iridescent translucent crystal quality, random color banding and scan lines, high-saturation Klein blue background with peach pink accents.\nTheme 5: Refined picture-book illustration style — clean flowing lines, premium beige monochrome with generous white space, slight low-angle perspective, delicate watercolor rendering, charming and whimsical with a childlike quality.\nTheme 6: Retro maximalism — staggered floral arrangements, richly detailed, predominantly natural and soft color tones, crisp line work, high-saturation colors delivering a luxurious feel.\nTheme 7: Casual doodle minimalism — childish and humorous, rough hand-drawn sketches, distorted forms, endearingly naive, with a hint of dreaminess, narrative quality, and a cozy healing atmosphere.\nPick only one theme to create from. Do not mix multiple themes.",
