		"settings.memory.modal.import.step1Desc": "",
		"settings.memory.modal.import.promptTemplate": "Please help me compile a personal usage profile. The purpose is to maintain a consistent collaborative experience across different AI tools. Base this on the long-term information you currently have access to about me, as well as the context from this conversation. When it comes to my instructions and preferences, please preserve my original wording as much as possible and avoid excessive rewriting.\n\nCategories (output in the following order)\n\nInstructions: The rules I have explicitly required to be followed, including tone, format, style, \"always do X,\" \"never do Y,\" and corrections to assistant behavior. Only include rules that can be clearly identified and objectively verified from long-term memory. Do not add new ones, do not impose assumptions, and do not infer requirements that I have not explicitly stated.\n\nIdentity: Name, age, location, education, family, relationships, language abilities, and personal interests (only include non-sensitive information that I have proactively shared; do not output private data such as ID numbers, contact details, or account information).\n\nCareer: Current and past roles, companies, and primary skill areas.\n\nProjects: Projects I have actually participated in building or invested effort in. One entry per project, including its function, current status, and key decisions. Start each entry with the project name or a short description.\n\nPreferences: Broadly applicable opinions, tastes, and work style preferences.\n\nFormat\n\nUse the category titles as section headers. Within each category, list one entry per line, ordered from earliest to latest by date. Each line should follow this format:\n\n[YYYY-MM-DD] - Entry content\n\nIf the date is unknown, use [unknown] instead.\n\nOutput\n\nWrap the entire profile in a code block so that I can easily copy it.\n\nAfter the code block, briefly explain: whether this fully covers all the relevant information you can currently compile; if there are any dimensions not included or entries you are uncertain about, list them so I can decide whether to supplement them.",
